{"3194960":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Distant Trails","steam_appid":3194960,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distant Trails is a single-player third-person adventure mystery following a group of trail runners on their travels. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3194960\/extras\/cf066215f1d9802b4876ff406699b0f1.poster.avif?t=1793741754\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3194960\/extras\/cf066215f1d9802b4876ff406699b0f1.webm?t=1793741754\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3194960\/extras\/cf066215f1d9802b4876ff406699b0f1.mp4?t=1793741754\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Protect the big outdoors:<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet getaway to a remote island to get back to nature and run some trails is about to take a twist into the unexpected.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your trail runners on an adventure through the varied landscape negotiating the terrain and managing your supplies. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work as a team to uncover the truth about what is happening on the island.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3194960\/extras\/d2065cab00e457b5644b5f5fe50c8802.poster.avif?t=1793741754\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3194960\/extras\/d2065cab00e457b5644b5f5fe50c8802.webm?t=1793741754\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3194960\/extras\/d2065cab00e457b5644b5f5fe50c8802.mp4?t=1793741754\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful muddy open world filled with story driven missions and running challenges.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed by a trail runner to have real world trail running problems to deal with like injury, fuelling and getting enough sleep.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physical running simulation with varying hill gradients and ground surfaces all affecting speed and foot grip.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management of supplies on the trail with limited space in backpacks.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control multiple characters with different running strengths to switch between and work together as a team.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous save system allows exiting the game at any time and resuming later or quick reloading if need to undo an action.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distant Trails is a single-player third-person adventure mystery following a group of trail runners on their travels. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3194960\/extras\/cf066215f1d9802b4876ff406699b0f1.poster.avif?t=1793741754\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3194960\/extras\/cf066215f1d9802b4876ff406699b0f1.webm?t=1793741754\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3194960\/extras\/cf066215f1d9802b4876ff406699b0f1.mp4?t=1793741754\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Protect the big outdoors:<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet getaway to a remote island to get back to nature and run some trails is about to take a twist into the unexpected.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your trail runners on an adventure through the varied landscape negotiating the terrain and managing your supplies. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work as a team to uncover the truth about what is happening on the island.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3194960\/extras\/d2065cab00e457b5644b5f5fe50c8802.poster.avif?t=1793741754\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3194960\/extras\/d2065cab00e457b5644b5f5fe50c8802.webm?t=1793741754\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3194960\/extras\/d2065cab00e457b5644b5f5fe50c8802.mp4?t=1793741754\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful muddy open world filled with story driven missions and running challenges.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed by a trail runner to have real world trail running problems to deal with like injury, fuelling and getting enough sleep.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physical running simulation with varying hill gradients and ground surfaces all affecting speed and foot grip.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management of supplies on the trail with limited space in backpacks.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control multiple characters with different running strengths to switch between and work together as a team.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous save system allows exiting the game at any time and resuming later or quick reloading if need to undo an action.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Explore open forest, steep mountains and muddy singletrack in this easy-paced outdoor adventure. Take a crew of trail runners out to remote locations to repair damage, protect nature and investigate unexpected events with only their feet for transport and a backpack to carry supplies.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3194960\/b33a68f43b26d380dfa01d92bca82665336500d7\/header.jpg?t=1793741754","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3194960\/df3320fbfd0353ee7a7cdfc1f1d63f9545e2e734\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793741754","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3194960\/df3320fbfd0353ee7a7cdfc1f1d63f9545e2e734\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793741754","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel i5-4670, AMD Ryzen 3 2300U or similar<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Geforce GTX 1060, Radeon RX 5600 or similar<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 10 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel i5-4670, AMD Ryzen 3 2300U or similar<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Geforce GTX 1060, Radeon RX 5600 or 